#!/bin/zsh
# P3.3 step 1 (decision 183, Mathis 2026-10-20): Codex sketches the daily screen, the one you meet on the first open
# of each day, after Finch's daily streak screen. Four frames in docs/design/p33/: morning, lit, comeback, new form.
# Plan: docs/plan-2.0/p33-daily-welcome.md. Re-run safe. Usage: p33-daily-sketch.sh [frame ...]. In resume-codex.sh.
ROOT="$(cd "$(dirname "$0")/.." && pwd)"; cd "$ROOT"
CODEX="/Applications/ChatGPT.app/Contents/Resources/codex-cli/bin/codex"; D=docs/design/p33
A=prototypes/p2-spikes/SpikeLab/Assets
REFS=(--image $D/refs/levelup-now.png --image $D/refs/home-now.png --image $A/depth-blaze-keyed.png --image $A/depth-kindled-keyed.png)
BASE="Design ONE full-screen iPhone app screen (tall portrait, iPhone 17 Pro proportions, about 1206x2622, status bar at the top), a high-fidelity UI design sketch of a game's DAILY STREAK screen: the screen the player meets the first time they open the app each day. It must make them want to come back every day and feel their real progress.
MATCH THE GAME: the first attached image is the game's current level-up screen and the second is its home screen. Use the same visual language: dark warm brown floor with a soft golden glow, champagne and gold accents, cream text, an elegant serif display font for titles and big words, a rounded bold font for numbers, the same XP bar style (dark track, champagne-to-gold fill with a softly glowing tip), the same gold Collect-style button at the bottom. Cards over the background have a crisp lip (a solid darker offset shape below them), never big blurry drop shadows; glows are painted soft gradients.
THE CHARACTER: the player's Flame, painted exactly like the attached Blaze sprite (third image; the fourth is the next form, Kindled), big and centred in the upper part of the screen, standing on a soft warm pool of light, happy, with warm golden sun-rays (a subtle radial sunburst of long soft wedges, gold on the dark brown, painted, not blurred) fanning out behind it. It is the hero of the screen.
STRUCTURE (inspired by Finch's daily streak screen: one character, big and centred, rays behind, one huge number, the week row with today's circle sparkling, one honest line, one button; its strength is how little it shows), top to bottom:
1) the Flame with rays; 2) a HUGE streak number with the words DAY STREAK under it, a small shield icon with 1 beside it (a shield saves one missed day); 3) the week row in a rounded dark card: letters M T W T F S S, each day a circle: lived days are small lit gold flame icons, today is described per frame below, future days are empty dark circles; 4) one story line in italic serif; 5) a compact 'growth' card with THREE rows separated by hairlines, each row: a small icon, a bold short title, a quiet detail on the right, and a slim bar under it. Each bar shows a FAINT GHOST segment (where the player was 7 days ago, a lighter translucent part of the track with a tiny tick mark) and the bright fill growing PAST it to today, so the week's gain is visible as the bright part beyond the ghost; 6) the daily 'why it matters' quote in small italic, centred; 7) the gold button.
Keep generous spacing, minimalist and premium, nothing crowded; every element must stay readable on a phone. Use exactly the texts given, in English, spelled exactly. It must be buildable in SwiftUI: flat painted shapes, gradients, icons, real text; no photographic blur."
typeset -A DESC
DESC[morning]="FRAME: MORNING, 'today waits' (the player has a 12-day streak and has not done today's quest yet; today is Friday). Huge number: 12. Under it: DAY STREAK. Week row: M T W T lit flames, F (today) is a glowing EMPTY gold ring with two small sparkles, softly pulsing, S S empty. Story line: '12 days in a row. Day 13 is waiting.' Growth card rows: (a) icon = a dark mysterious silhouette of the next form, title 'Kindled in 2 days', detail '12 / 14', bar with a short ghost at the start and the bright fill to 5/7 of the track, with the dark silhouette of the Kindled form sitting at the END of the bar like a goal; (b) icon = a small gold level star with 6, title 'Level 6', detail '+340 XP this week', bar with ghost to 30% and bright fill to 75%; (c) icon = a round orange Strength medallion with a fist, title 'Strength · level 4', detail '+2 levels this week', bar ghost to 15%, bright fill to 60%. Quote: 'Every quest is a vote for who you're becoming.' Button: 'Let's go' followed by a small gold coin and '+5'. Save it as $D/daily-morning.png."
DESC[lit]="FRAME: LIT, the payoff right after the first quest of the day (a short 2-second moment). The Flame is brighter and joyful, a burst of small gold sparks around it. Huge number: 13, just ticked up from 12, with a small '+1' rising. Under it: DAY STREAK. Week row: M T W T lit flames, F (today) NOW LIT, bigger than the others, with a ring of gold sparkles bursting from it, S S empty. Story line: 'Day 13 kept. One day closer to Kindled.' Growth card: only the first row, 'Kindled tomorrow', detail '13 / 14', bar bright fill to 6/7 with the dark Kindled silhouette at the end of the bar now faintly glowing at its edges. No quote. No button (it closes by itself), only a tiny 'Tap to continue' at the bottom. Save it as $D/daily-lit.png."
DESC[comeback]="FRAME: COMEBACK MORNING (the player missed two days, their 12-day streak ended; today is Wednesday; their best ever is 12 days). The Flame is visibly DIMMER and smaller fire (its light is low after days away) but still smiling warmly, never sad or broken; the rays behind it are fainter. In place of the huge number: a huge OUTLINED (unfilled) '1' waiting to be lit, under it 'A NEW FLAME TODAY', and a small capsule 'Best: 12 days'. Week row: M lit flame, T empty dim (missed, no cross, no red), W (today) a glowing EMPTY gold ring with sparkles, the rest empty. Story line: 'Your 12-day flame is resting. Your best is 12, and your forms are yours forever. Ready to beat it?' Growth card rows: (a) 'Kindled in 14 days', detail 'from day 1', bar empty with the dark Kindled silhouette at its end; (b) 'Level 6', detail '+90 XP this week', bar ghost to 40%, bright to 55%; (c) 'Calm · level 3', detail '12 XP to level 4', bar bright to 85%. Quote: 'A missed day is a bump. Let's never miss twice.' Button: 'Let's go' with a small gold coin '+5'. Warm and welcoming, zero guilt. Save it as $D/daily-comeback.png."
DESC[newform]="FRAME: NEW FORM, the player's first quest of the day just reached a 14-day streak and the Flame evolved from Blaze into Kindled. The Flame shown is now the KINDLED form (fourth attached image), centred, larger, bathed in a strong golden radiance with rays at full strength and a ring of sparks; behind it, a fading ghost outline of the old Blaze form. Above it a small label 'NEW FORM'. Big title in serif: 'Your Flame became a Kindled'. Under it the number 14 and DAY STREAK, smaller than in the morning frame. Week row: all days up to today lit, today lit with sparkles. Line: '14 days in a row. This form is yours for good.' Growth card: one row, 'Next: Radiant in 16 days', bar empty with a dark silhouette at its end. Button: 'Keep going'. Save it as $D/daily-newform.png."
if (( $# )); then frames=($@); else frames=(morning lit comeback newform); fi
for f in $frames; do
  out=$D/daily-$f.png
  [[ -f $out ]] && { echo "exists: $out"; continue; }
  "$CODEX" exec -s workspace-write --ephemeral -C "$ROOT" "${REFS[@]}" -- "$BASE
${DESC[$f]} Use your image generation tool. Do not create or edit any other file." < /dev/null > /dev/null 2>&1
  [[ -f $out ]] && echo "done: $out" || echo "MISSING: $out"
done
